32589d65e0f)) (text "LIGHT: six WS2812B-Mini pixels (daisy chain), each with 100 nF" (at 21.5 222 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left)) (uuid fec4fe10-eca8-4d26-ad1b-f58a5fc48224)) (rectangle (start 186 219) (end 346 311) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid d647fe2f-14ed-422c-8564-be32648652b5)) (text "TRIGGER, SOUND, HAPTIC" (at 187.5 222 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left)) (uuid 0b51be96-eb92-41a6-ac32-09c038ae80e2)) (text "ASTRADAND: hold the trigger, draw a shape in the air, release. The 6-axis IMU is read over I2C at 50 Hz; the" (at 20 385 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid b44c4bb9-38af-438f-b4b0-4c1de5e130ac)) (text "ATmega matches the drawn path against six spell templates. Piezo is driven differentially from OC1A/OC1B" (at 20 388.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid b83b010a-b6e9-40fe-98f1-669a8568626e)) (text "(D9/D10). LEDs are fed from +4V5 through a high-side switch (Q3, driven by Q4 from D5) and a Schottky (D20)," (at 20 391.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 7ec0dcc9-faa2-458c-bccf-854626f932a9)) (text "so the pixels draw nothing in sleep so that their 0.7 x VDD data threshold stays below the 3.3 V logic level;" (at 20 395.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 6d7107e7-a508-40f4-a182-5a882711c5f7)) (text "the firmware caps the pixel current." (at 20 398.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid fb1197fe-5740-4cdf-b58c-e4596957430d)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))